    {
      "fragment_type": "behavioral_spec",
      "content": "Emission: The equipment under test (EUT) was configured to measure its highest possible emission level. The test conditions were adapted accordingly in reference to the instructions for use. Immunity: The equipment under test (EUT) was configured to have its highest possible susceptibility against the tested phenomena. The test conditions were adapted accordingly in reference to the instructions for use.",
