      "fragment_type": "constraint_statement",
      "content": "Measurement Uncertainty according to CISPR 16-4-2. The measurement uncertainty represents an expanded uncertainty expressed at approximately the 95% confidence level using a coverage factor of k=2. Conducted Emission at mains port using AMN (150kHz-30MHz): 3.2dB (U_cispr 3.4dB). Radiated Emission (30MHz-1000MHz): 3.9dB (U_cispr 6.3dB). Radiated Emission (1GHz-6GHz): 5.1dB (U_cispr 5.2dB).",
